"quotes":[{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-04-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"In March, 23andMe was granted the first FDA authorization for a direct-to-consumer genetic test for cancer risk.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/25/illumina-ilmn-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-04-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Building on the direct-to-consumer inflection we saw in 2017, our microarray business had a spectacular start to 2018 with 48% growth to a record $152 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/25/illumina-ilmn-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-04-24","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Dan Leonard","x":"One big factor, obviously, that we've talked about is the DTC market, the direct-to-consumer market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/25/illumina-ilmn-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-04-24","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Dan Leonard","x":"We're also seeing a -- this phenomenon take hold outside the U.S. We are tracking now over 100 companies around the world that are targeting the direct-to-consumer market, and we're seeing some pretty exciting emerging companies, for example, in China where the opportunity is clearly sizable, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/25/illumina-ilmn-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-07-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Moving to arrays, microarray revenue grew 25% year-over-year to $140 million, with growth not only in the direct-to-consumer or DTC, but also in global research applications spanning genotyping and epigenetics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/31/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-07-30","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Donnelly","x":"But there are a number of other levers that are emerging, and one that's definitely interesting is the direct-to-consumer opportunity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/31/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-07-30","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"While sequentially microarray revenue was down associated with the DTC functionality, we foresee robust demand for arrays as DTC broadens across geographies, applications, and providers, as precision medicine initiatives expand and research and applied uses for arrays increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/31/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-07-30","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"In addition to robust sequencing consumable growth, APJ also reported strong array growth, driven by a small but rapidly growing DTC customer offering that test serviced across Asia that is based on our Screening Array.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/31/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"This included about $13 million of stocking associated with Chinese customers buying ahead of potential tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/31/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"We continue to monitor the tariff situation closely in China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/31/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-10-23","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Array instrument revenue of $16 million was higher than we expected and the largest revenue contribution since 2011, driven by a large key DTC customer scaling ahead of anticipated holiday demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-10-23","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"While there is seasonality, we continue to be impressed with the rate of growth we're seeing among our DTC customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"In the third quarter of 2018, sequencing consumable revenue of $467 million grew 23% compared to the third quarter of 2017 and included about $14 million of stocking associated with Chinese customers buying ahead of potential tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"In the third quarter, our sequencing consumable business once again benefited from a handful of Chinese customers buying ahead of anticipated tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2018-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Dan Leonard","x":"…at the population sequencing initiatives, it's clear that governments all around the world are recognizing the value of population genomics studies as a fundamental enabler to precision medicine and those initiatives around improving both the quality of the healthcare system and driving cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-01-29","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Derik De Bruin","x":"So in working with our direct-to-consumer customers and looking at 2018, they felt that the right answer was to think about growth moderating given the size of the numbers they've seen over the last couple of years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/illumina-ilmn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-01-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"…specific customers, but we've talked about the fact that we've taken a more cautious view on the array growth and specifically DTC growth in 2019, as Francis mentioned earlier, as a result of our conversations, our work with our customers in the DTC space and really looking at their forecast.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/illumina-ilmn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-01-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"And that's a more predictable business, unlike DTC where we've seen significant growth over the last two years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/illumina-ilmn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Greater China grew 8% year-over-year with sequencing growth moderated by the effects of tariff-related stocking in Q2 and Q3 of 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/illumina-ilmn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2018 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"When adjusting for the tariff impact, the region grew 28% from the prior-year period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/illumina-ilmn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-04-25","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Array consumables were down 15% from the same quarter a year ago, with growth in non-DTC customers partially offsetting a larger than expected decline in DTC revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/illumina-inc-ilmn-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-04-25","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Although we continue to see growth in DTC outside the U.S., we are factoring in even greater caution around the DTC business for the rest of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/illumina-inc-ilmn-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-07-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"Excluding lower than expected revenues associated with our direct-to-consumer array business, the region's performance was largely in line with our expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-07-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Consistent with our pre-announcement, second quarter revenue of $838 million was impacted by three factors: the timing of population genomics initiatives; lower than expected DTC revenue; and lower than expected revenue associated with our non-high throughput portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-07-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Next, the ongoing weakness in the DTC market has resulted in a significant shortfall in our array business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"Greater China was down 9% to $97 million, but allowing for the $13 million tariff stocking orders that we shipped in the second quarter of 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"…the quarterly growth was lower than what we've seen over the past few quarters in terms of China, and we have had some choppiness in China over the past few quarters because -- more so because of tariffs and some pre-buying ahead of tariffs, although we didn't have any of that this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"And in terms of guidance, our guidance reflects really a much lower outlook for these population genomics initiatives in 2019 in the second half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-10-24","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Arrays continue to be a headwind for Illumina in the third quarter both sequentially and year-over-year, primarily due to DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-10-24","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"While we do not expect DTC to return to growth in the near term, we do believe that individuals will be engaging more directly with their genomic information through services like this in the future and we remain optimistic in the opportunity for consumer genomics over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"Greater China was down 7% year-over-year, but, allowing for the net $6 million in tariff stocking activity from the third quarter of 2018, revenue was down 1%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"Moving to product revenue, sequencing consumables grew 11% from the same quarter a year ago to $525 million or 13% allowing for the tariff stocking activity in the third quarter of 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2019-10-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"So the lower pull-through that we're seeing with regards to NextSeq and with regards to MiSeq, that drives most of the lower guidance that we're expecting for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-01-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"And finally, arrays delivered revenue of $116 million, down 12% from the same quarter in 2018 due to continued headwinds from our direct-to-consumer customers, offset in part by array growth in genetic disease research.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/illumina-inc-ilmn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-01-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Highlights included 22% year-over-year sequencing consumable growth and stronger than expected IVD partnership and non-DTC array revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/illumina-inc-ilmn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-01-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"This more than offset softer sequencing system revenue, and weaker than expected DTC revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/illumina-inc-ilmn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2019 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"Greater China grew 21% from prior year quarter, with an easy year-over-year comp associated with tariff-related stocking in China in the fourth quarter of 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/illumina-inc-ilmn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-04-30","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Doug Schenkel","x":"And in my opinion, one of the slower markets maybe to recover would be the direct to consumer market, directly because of the things [Phonetic] that Sam talked about earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-04-30","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Our array services business grew sequentially as we expected, given the normal seasonality associated with DTC, but declined year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-04-30","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jacquie Ross","x":"Array consumables declined both sequentially and year-over-year, consistent with our expectations of the DTC market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"We are also preparing for additional cost savings opportunities if shelter-in-place orders remain prevalent into the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"First, let me say, I mean even in the first half of the year given where we are today and what we know today, we are taking a significant amount of cost out of the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-08-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"Total array revenue was $67 million, down 39% from the same quarter last year and down 32% from the first quarter of 2020, in part, due to our lower expectations of the DTC market and its normal seasonality in addition to COVID-19-related headwinds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/illumina-inc-ilmn-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-10-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Juliet Cunningham","x":"Total microarray revenue of $86 million was up 28% sequentially as direct-to-consumer customers and other applications began recovering from pandemic-related headwinds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2020-10-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"…and microarrays up modestly on a sequential basis as we continue to see a gradual recovery in direct-to-consumer and genotyping applications For the rest of the P&L, we expect sequential decline in non-GAAP gross margin, in part, driven by product mix with higher contribution from instrument…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2021-02-11","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"Revenue in the region was 2% lower compared to the prior year quarter, which was primarily driven by one-time technology access fees for an IVD partnership and lower DTC revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/illumina-inc-ilmn-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"We expect full year non-GAAP gross margin to modestly improve from 2020 reflecting increased leverage from higher volumes and cost savings initiatives partially offset by product mix, and IVD partnership revenue in the first quarter of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/illumina-inc-ilmn-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2020 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Sung Ji Nam","x":"And then the second question is you guys talked about the improvement on the flow cell, the order of magnitude improvement leading to roughly 90% of cost savings for the flow cell.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/illumina-inc-ilmn-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2021 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2021-04-27","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Tejas Savant","x":"There's the direct-to-consumer part, and then there's sort of ag, and maybe Sam will talk a little bit about how those parts play out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/illumina-inc-ilmn-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2021 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2021-04-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"The fact of the matter is DTC is now a very small part of our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/illumina-inc-ilmn-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2021 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2021-04-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Sam Samad","x":"Back in 2018, DTC was a much bigger contributor to our overall revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/illumina-inc-ilmn-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2021 Q3","e":"ilmn","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Dan Brennan","x":"After a really strong start to the year, you're raising guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/illumina-inc-ilmn-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2025 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ankur Dhingra","x":"Tariffs had a partial impact this quarter with a net impact of approximately 110 basis points on our gross margin in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/03/illumina-ilmn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2025 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ankur Dhingra","x":"Some of them from last year and then some based on the actions we took in the early part of the year here beginning to get reflected in the P&L. The tariff side, we started work on it and beginning to see a pathway towards reducing the impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/03/illumina-ilmn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2025 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2025-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Tycho Peterson","x":"Was that all a unwind or from the cost out programs or both?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/03/illumina-ilmn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2025 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2025-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jacob Thaysen","x":"That said, we are raising our guidance for total company revenue growth as well as total reported revenue, non-GAAP operating margin, and non-GAAP EPS, reflecting strong execution and operating discipline across the organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/03/illumina-ilmn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2025 Q2","e":"ilmn","d":"2025-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ankur Dhingra","x":"In closing, I want to express my continued appreciation to the Illumina team for their relentless focus on execution and delivering another quarter of progress towards our short and long-term goals, which is allowing us to raise the guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/03/illumina-ilmn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2025 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jacob Thaysen","x":"For the first time, four key enabling capabilities are converging: sequencing at scale, tools to perturb biology using CRISPR at genome-wide levels, dedicated compute power to analyze it, and AI to build predictive biological models.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/illumina-ilmn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2025 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ankur Dhingra","x":"Moving to the rest of the P&L, non-GAAP gross margin of 67% for the fourth quarter was down 40 basis points year over year, primarily from the tariff impact of 205 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/illumina-ilmn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2025 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ankur Dhingra","x":"Excluding tariffs, gross margins improved by 165 basis points sequentially.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/illumina-ilmn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2025 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ankur Dhingra","x":"Operating expenses were $502 million, down 5% or $24 million year over year, reflecting the results of the multiyear cost reduction programs and prioritization of key growth investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/illumina-ilmn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2025 Q4","e":"ilmn","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Dave Westenberg","x":"That is a direct cost reduction to a lot of your customers in terms of cost per gigabase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/illumina-ilmn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2026 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2026-04-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ankur Dhingra","x":"Microarrays business was down 20% on a Rest of World organic basis, largely due to specific large customers in the direct-to-consumer segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/illumina-ilmn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2026 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ankur Dhingra","x":"Moving to the rest of the P&L. Non-GAAP gross margin of 68.2% for the first quarter was up 80 basis points year over year, driven by cost efficiencies and higher revenue, partly offset by tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/illumina-ilmn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2026 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jacob Thaysen","x":"We are raising our 2026 guidance to reflect the Q1 outperformance, which we will discuss in more detail later in our prepared remarks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/illumina-ilmn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2026 Q1","e":"ilmn","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ankur Dhingra","x":"Overall, we had a great start to 2026, allowing us to raise our full-year guidance and reinforce our confidence in the progress we are making towards our long-range targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/illumina-ilmn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ILMN 2026 Q2","e":"ilmn","d"